    "detailed_description": "You stopped by the museum to give artistic inquiry and food for the mind.<br />\r\nMany of the artworks in the museum made you feel rich<br />\r\nSometimes I got goosebumps, sometimes I was touched and made to cry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou couldn't overcome the lingering emotions and visited the museum several times<br />\r\nI found a door in a secluded corner that I had never seen before.<br />\r\nYou are an adventurous person.<br />\r\nYou have doubts about the sudden appearance of the door, but you end up grabbing the handle of the door.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGallery: Moa's Room is a puzzle first-person single horror game.<br />\r\nVarious objects must interact with each other and escape from the room by reasoning based on hints.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\n- the grotesque phenomena and mysteries that unfold on the stage of the museum<br />\r\n- Level design with fact-based 3D modeling<br />\r\n- The basic operation is movement, investigation, and object interaction, and the difficulty level is designed for those who are not good at games to enjoy<br />\r\n- Game design for multiple rounds of play, including raising the stage over time, as well as revealing hints and creating escape room conditions<br />\r\n- Various events and puzzles that take place within one huge level",
    "about_the_game": "You stopped by the museum to give artistic inquiry and food for the mind.<br />\r\nMany of the artworks in the museum made you feel rich<br />\r\nSometimes I got goosebumps, sometimes I was touched and made to cry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou couldn't overcome the lingering emotions and visited the museum several times<br />\r\nI found a door in a secluded corner that I had never seen before.<br />\r\nYou are an adventurous person.<br />\r\nYou have doubts about the sudden appearance of the door, but you end up grabbing the handle of the door.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n------------------------------<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGallery: Moa's Room is a puzzle first-person single horror game.<br />\r\nVarious objects must interact with each other and escape from the room by reasoning based on hints.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\n- the grotesque phenomena and mysteries that unfold on the stage of the museum<br />\r\n- Level design with fact-based 3D modeling<br />\r\n- The basic operation is movement, investigation, and object interaction, and the difficulty level is designed for those who are not good at games to enjoy<br />\r\n- Game design for multiple rounds of play, including raising the stage over time, as well as revealing hints and creating escape room conditions<br />\r\n- Various events and puzzles that take place within one huge level",
